### Accounts - Get Accounts
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/api/v1/accounts

### Accounts - Get Account by id
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/api/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}

### Accounts - Create new Account
POST http://localhost:{{port}}/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "balance": 150000.00,
  "currency": "MXN",
  "name": "Main"
}

### Accounts - Delete Account by id
DELETE http://localhost:{{port}}/api/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}

### Accounts - Update Balance
PATCH http://localhost:{{port}}/api/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/balance
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": -10000.00
}